{"4581420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lethal Ghosts", "steam_appid": 4581420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Lethal Ghosts, Investigator ...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.poster.avif?t=1778188173\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.webm?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.mp4?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a <strong>rookie investigato</strong>r taking your first steps into the world of paranormal investigation. What begins as simple ghost‑hunting assignments will gradually evolve into something far more dangerous - a path that leads you toward becoming a fully trained Demon Exorcist capable of confronting the most lethal entities known to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Ghosts is a unique 2D Isometric Ghost Hunting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore several <strong>unique, handcrafted maps</strong>, each filled with clues, environmental details, and hidden dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to gather as much information as possible, analyze the evidence you uncover, and determine the exact type of entity haunting the location. Every entity behaves differently - some stalk, some hide, some manipulate the environment - and learning their patterns is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll unlock new tools, new challenges, and eventually new threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features a New Game+ mode, introducing additional entity types and raising the stakes with each completed run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Ghosts offers a <strong>deep level of contract customization</strong>, allowing you to tailor every investigation to your preferred difficulty, pacing, and intensity. No two contracts ever play the same - each one is a unique experience shaped by your settings, the environment, and the unpredictable behavior of the entities themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself. Every investigation brings you one step closer to the truth… and one step deeper into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/9e437ae04066b572cb297d786f73fb37.poster.avif?t=1778188173\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/9e437ae04066b572cb297d786f73fb37.webm?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/9e437ae04066b572cb297d786f73fb37.mp4?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45+ Unique Entities with their own behavior to investigate and fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each contract features a unique entity with its own backstory, cause of death, and family history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, addictive, yet complex gameplay loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different locations with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customisation and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep contract customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of various tools and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generation of Contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex NG+ system ensuring practically endless playability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique features such as astral projecting, watching remote camera footage and even stealing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/8850de3a7d2e9f5ba24fe4e0bfd700c4.poster.avif?t=1778188173\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/8850de3a7d2e9f5ba24fe4e0bfd700c4.webm?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/8850de3a7d2e9f5ba24fe4e0bfd700c4.mp4?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a Contract, get to investigation area, equip yourself with suitable items and go investigate right now!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Lethal Ghosts, Investigator ...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.poster.avif?t=1778188173\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.webm?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581420/extras/074d6ef749e5514f9ff7d464a8ede36c.mp4?t=1778188173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr